          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p>The SIHOO Doro C300 Pro V2 is designed to adapt to the way you sit, work and unwind. Featuring SIHOO's next-generation DynaCore™ Full-Body Support System, it synchronises the headrest, backrest, lumbar support and armrests to move naturally with your body. Whether you're working long hours, attending meetings or taking a well-earned break, the Doro C300 Pro V2 delivers personalised ergonomic comfort throughout the day.</p>",
