        "accordion_P6igYg": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Features",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>DynaCore™ Full-Body Support System: </strong>Keeps your head, back, lumbar region and arms aligned as your body naturally changes position.</p><p><strong>SyncroFlex™ Back-Glide System: </strong>Follows your spine as you recline, delivering continuous support without constant manual adjustments.</p><p><strong>Self-Adaptive Dynamic Lumbar Support 2.0: </strong>Enhanced dual lumbar support responds to your movements, helping reduce pressure on your lower back throughout the day.</p><p><strong>8D Bionic Armrests: </strong>Adjust in multiple directions to provide ergonomic support while typing, gaming, reading or relaxing.</p><p><strong>Ultra-Wide Adjustable Headrest: </strong>Offers broader neck support with multi-directional adjustment for improved comfort in both upright and reclined positions.</p><p><strong>Waterfall Seat with Adjustable Depth: </strong>Distributes pressure more evenly while allowing a personalised seating position for different body types.</p>",
