          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Benefits",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Ergonomic Support That Moves With You: </strong>Unlike traditional office chairs, the Doro C300 Pro V2 adapts as you move, helping maintain consistent support throughout your workday.</li><li><strong>Personalised Comfort From the First Sit:</strong> Intelligent ergonomic adjustments automatically work with your posture, creating a seating experience tailored to your body.</li><li><strong>Built for Long Hours: </strong>Designed for professionals, remote workers, students and gamers who spend extended periods at their desk.</li><li><strong>Comfort in Every Position: </strong>Whether you're focused on work, collaborating in meetings or reclining during a break, the chair continues to provide balanced support.</li><li><strong>Premium Quality for Everyday Use: </strong>Constructed with durable materials and rigorously tested components to deliver reliable ergonomic performance for years to come.</li></ul>",
