    "faq_aFhnMb": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_ChnMrL": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes the SIHOO Doro C300 Pro V2 different from the Doro C300 Pro?",
            "answer": "<p>The Doro C300 Pro V2 introduces several upgraded ergonomic features, including the DynaCore™ Full-Body Support System, Domino™ Sacral-Lumbar Support, SyncroFlex™ Back-Glide System and 8D Bionic Armrests. These enhancements are designed to provide more personalised support and a wider range of adjustments for different sitting styles.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Nbjiw6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the Doro C300 Pro V2 suitable for long hours of sitting?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The chair is designed for people who spend extended periods at their desk. Its ergonomic support system, breathable mesh construction and multiple adjustment points help create a more comfortable seating experience throughout the working day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_qciCPr": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can the Doro C300 Pro V2 be adjusted to suit different body types?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The chair offers multiple ergonomic adjustments, including an adjustable headrest, seat depth, armrests, lumbar support and recline positions. These features allow users to customise the chair for a more personalised fit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7kwEB3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the mesh seat comfortable for Australia's warmer working environments?",
            "answer": "<p>The Doro C300 Pro V2 features a breathable mesh backrest and seat that promote airflow while you're seated. This helps improve comfort during long work sessions, particularly in warmer environments or home offices without constant air conditioning.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_UmcbjN": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who is the Doro C300 Pro V2 designed for?",
            "answer": "<p>The Doro C300 Pro V2 is ideal for professionals, remote workers, students and anyone looking for ergonomic support during long hours of sitting. It's well suited to home offices, corporate workplaces and study spaces where comfort and adjustability are important.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
